.

00:47:00.680 --> 00:47:01.140
.

00:47:01.140 --> 00:47:01.320
.

00:47:01.320 --> 00:47:01.360
.

00:47:01.360 --> 00:47:01.500
.

00:47:01.500 --> 00:47:02.120
.

00:47:11.120 --> 00:47:12.100
You.

00:47:14.880 --> 00:47:18.600
Bye-bye!

00:47:47.210 --> 00:47:49.310
You know, Sesame Street has been brought to you today

00:47:49.310 --> 00:47:56.280
by the letter L and by the number four.

00:47:58.400 --> 00:47:59.960
And now I'm done with my

00:48:00.000 --> 00:48:00.480
Laundry.

00:48:01.660 --> 00:48:02.840
See you next time on Sesame Street.
